Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD terminal completion-state coverage to protect patch
 chat reopening

Exercise the reviewed-patch lifecycle rows through the terminal harness so DONE? remains highlighted, closed rows lose ready highlighting, and typing into a closed chat clears closure before sending follow-up text.
